atlas:data-poisoning                 skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-2 .
atlas:poor-model-accuracy            skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-7-3 .
atlas:data-curation                  skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-7-3 .
atlas:incomplete-advice              skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-7-3 .
atlas:data-usage-restrictions        skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-7-3 .
atlas:hallucination                  skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-3-1 .
atlas:decision-bias                  skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-1-1 .
atlas:impact-on-the-environment      skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-6-6 .
atlas:confidential-information-in-data skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-1 .
atlas:ip-information-in-prompt         skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-1 .
atlas:revealing-confidential-information skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-1 .
atlas:attribute-inference-attack       skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-2 .
atlas:membership-inference-attack      skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-2 .
atlas:jailbreaking                     skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-2 .
atlas:prompt-priming                   skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-2 .
atlas:harmful-code-generation          skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-2 .
atlas:data-acquisition                 skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-7-3 .
atlas:data-contamination               skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-7-3 .
atlas:improper-retraining              skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-7-3 .
atlas:unrepresentative-data            skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-7-3 .
atlas:inaccessible-training-data       skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-7-4 .
atlas:untraceable-attribution          skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-7-4 .
